9. STRING FUNCTIONS
paste()
paste0()
substr()
nchar()
toupper()
tolower()
grep()
gsub()

| Function    | Purpose                     | Example               |
| ----------- | --------------------------- | --------------------- |
| `paste()`   | Join text with separator    | `paste("A","B")`      |
| `paste0()`  | Join text without separator | `paste0("A","B")`     |
| `substr()`  | Extract part of string      | `substr("Hello",1,3)` |
| `nchar()`   | Count characters            | `nchar("Hello")`      |
| `toupper()` | Uppercase text              | `toupper("hi")`       |
| `tolower()` | Lowercase text              | `tolower("HI")`       |
| `grep()`    | Search pattern              | `grep("a", x)`        |
| `gsub()`    | Replace text                | `gsub("a","b",x)`     |


