14. APPLY FUNCTIONS
apply()
lapply()
sapply()
tapply()

| Function   | Works On          | Returns           | Main Use          |
| ---------- | ----------------- | ----------------- | ----------------- |
| `apply()`  | matrix/data frame | vector/matrix     | rows & columns    |
| `lapply()` | list              | list              | apply to list     |
| `sapply()` | list/vector       | simplified output | easy output       |
| `tapply()` | grouped data      | grouped result    | category analysis |


| Function   | Think Like            |
| ---------- | --------------------- |
| `apply()`  | apply on rows/columns |
| `lapply()` | list apply            |
| `sapply()` | simple apply          |
| `tapply()` | table/group apply     |



